## Measure the setup envelope (no gateway run needed)

  cd services/gateway
  npx tsx <scratch>/measure-tools.ts      # per mode/surface: 2 / 290 / 134 declarations
  npx tsx <scratch>/measure-groups.ts     # core 65 = 96 KB, domain 225 = 130 KB
  npx tsx <scratch>/scan-schemas.ts       # no invalid JSON-schema keywords
  → outputs/tool-catalog-measurements.txt

## Controlled live isolation against staging (test account only; voice
## session start/stop, the documented narrow exception)

  export SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=<publishable key from vitana-v1/.env>
  export TEST_ACCOUNT_EMAIL=e2e-test@vitana.dev TEST_ACCOUNT_PASSWORD=<documented>
  node scripts/orb/verify-vertex-serbian-bridge.mjs --mode=authenticated --trials=8
  node scripts/orb/verify-vertex-serbian-bridge.mjs --mode=authenticated --trials=8 --route=/admin
  → outputs/live-experiment-staging-2026-09-17.txt  (2/8 vs 8/8)

